  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Component 1: Support to the World Bank Health Sector Transformation Project- HSTP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Providing access to child health, maternal, GBV, and critical nutrition services and delivering across 816 GoSS facilities and at the boma level. Providing essential medicines to tackle leading causes of maternal and child mortality (malaria, diarrhoea, and pneumonia), malnutrition (micronutrient supplements), emergencies and disease outbreaks (cholera), and uterotonics to prevent/ treat postpartum haemorrhage, etc. Strengthening core health system capacities that are needed in order to save lives, blood banks, laboratory infrastructure, and emergency preparedness and response.</narrative>
  </description>
